                "text_R3yC83": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Long before matcha became a global wellness trend, founders Darla Murray and Chantal Shah were discovering it for themselves. After being introduced to matcha in the 1990s, they attended their first traditional Japanese tea ceremony in Tokyo in 2002—an experience that sparked a lifelong appreciation for the craft, culture, and care behind every bowl.</p><p>Enjoying good matcha is still their favorite part of their day. </p>",
